# Prettier owns Astro, MDX, Markdown, and YAML formatting in this repo (run it via
# `npm run format:md`). Biome owns JS/TS/JSON/JSONC/CSS; SQL is governed by
# supaschema's parser/deparser/semantic checks, not a text formatter — see
# .claude/rules/06-multi-language-toolchain.md and 08-biome-ultracite-policy.md.
# Prettier 3.x also reads .gitignore; these entries keep direct `prettier` runs scoped.

# Dependencies, build output, caches, scratch graph state.
**/node_modules/**
dist/**
coverage/**
out/
.tmp/**
docs/.blume/**
docs/.blume-verify/**

# Python (uv workspace) virtualenvs + tool caches — never Prettier's concern.
**/.venv/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.ruff_cache/**
**/.mypy_cache/**

# Generated agent-surface mirrors — format the `.claude` source instead and let
# `npm run sync:llm` regenerate these; generated mirrors are writer-owned.
.agents/**
.codex/**
agent-bundle/**

# Committed reference tree — never reformatted.
.claude/plans/**
